# The build context is the workspace. node_modules is a pnpm store of absolute symlinks to paths that do not exist
# in the image (a container that fails at import time for reasons that look nothing like "wrong node_modules");
# .git is simply large.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.pnpm-store

# Agent and editor state: not part of the product, and changing constantly,
# which would bust the build cache on every session.
.claude
.agents
.vscode
skills-lock.json
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Reference material, never for running: repos/effect is 53 MB of Effect's own source, which the image gets from
# node_modules like any other dependency.
repos
agent-patterns

*.log
.DS_Store
